(502,1114,'A disease caused by a lack of vitamin C and characterized by spongy gums, loosening of the teeth, and bleeding into the skin and mucous membranes.','en',2,'2026-06-24 11:41:51',NULL,NULL,'892FFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF'),
