(858,1752,'Conditions characterized by language abilities (comprehension and expression of speech and writing) that are below the expected level for a given age, generally in the absence of an intellectual impairment. These conditions may be associated with DEAFNESS; BRAIN DISEASES; MENTAL DISORDERS; or environmental factors.','en',2,'2026-06-24 11:42:06',NULL,NULL,'10240FFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF'),
