(1219,2600,'Disorder of cardiac function due to an imbalance between myocardial function and the capacity of the coronary vessels to supply sufficient flow for normal function. It is a form of MYOCARDIAL ISCHEMIA (insufficient blood supply to the heart muscle) caused by a decreased capacity of the coronary vessels.','en',2,'2026-06-24 11:42:24',NULL,NULL,'5840FFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF'),
